// Parked vehicles (v36, protocol/cpp/parked.h): only bicycles, motorbikes and the quad wait parked. At each of the five
// stables a Sanchez, in Riverwood a BMX by the road, and on the road below Fort Greymoor, where round 2's Rhino stood and
// blocked it, nothing. scripts/skytest.ps1 run scenarios/parked.json (scenarios/README.md). San Andreas's log says what it
// parked ("vehicle: SANCHEZ (468) parked at spot 1 (the Whiterun stables)").
//
// `asr.vehicles` answers every vehicle drawn: health (1000 new), wrecked, burning, smoking (under 650: something damaged
// it), up (1 upright) and above (how far its box's bottom is over Skyrim's ground there, units). The limits at each stable
// (CJ handed over there as on the road below the Whiterun stables, where one once caught fire and blew up on its own 19 s on)
// and in Riverwood:
//   health > 990, not wrecked, burning or smoking ... untouched
//   up > 0.9 ......................................... upright (a bike on its side stand leans a few degrees)
//   above within -15 and 25 .......................... on the ground: wheels touching it, not sunk in nor floating (35 cm)
// looked at 10, 30 and 60 s after it was parked at every stable, 12 s after in Riverwood;
// each with a screenshot. Within 50 m of Riverwood's marker (the BMX's spot is 11 m from it) at least one vehicle; within
// 160 m (the drop radius) of the old Rhino spot none, 12 s after the handover.
{
  "name": "parked",
  "continueOnFail": true,
  "steps": [
    // ---- Whiterun stables
    {"cmd": "console", "command": "cow Tamriel 4 -3", "label": "to Whiterun stables"},
    "wait seconds=8",
